      "{'text': 'Our Fearless1 Bra is a huge hit! We took everything you love about our Vitality Bra and gave it a little twist! Like our Vitality Bra, the Fearless1 Bra offers the perfect balance between softness and elasticity. This bra was designed to fit the everyday athlete and offer maximum comfort, even for a more muscular feminine build. The Fearless1 Bra’s custom nylon/lycra fabric blend allows this bra to move with you during your toughest workouts, all while bringing fashion and style right along with it! They also come with removable pad inserts for maximum support.', 'timestamp': '2019-04-19 14:59:36', 'url': 'http://www.sportevo.pro/born-primitive/elastic-and-soft-sports-bra-maximum-comfort-fearless-envy-p-1264.html?osCsid=m9nvepnciso585870gjleoatf5'}\n",
      "{'text': 'I recently watched the movie Facing the Giants about a football coach and football team that was muddling somewhere between hapless and mediocrety. The reason for their dismal performance was their attitude. Their attitude that they were going to lose before the game began.\\nThere is a very interesting turn of events in this movie that needs to be watched to be believed.\\nWhether you wake up saying “Good Morning God”, or “Good God, morning” will likely set the tone for the rest of yours (and the people around you) day.\\nYour attitude in the morning creates the filter in which you see the world. If you wake up grumpy you will likely have a challenging day. Wake up happy and you will find your day will go much smoother.\\nThe cool thing is the choice is yours.\\nIf you get up with the first thought in the morning you will likely have a great day. However, if you get up with the second thought, I can guarantee you won’t.\\nInstead you will be like that Peanuts character, Pig Pen, who has a dark dust cloud following him everywhere.\\nThat negative attitude will not only ensure that your day will go sour, but your body language will alert others to stay away.\\nSo, make up your mind to be a happy, positive person and you will find that happiness will find you.', 'timestamp': '2019-04-24 04:00:54', 'url': 'https://relmes.wordpress.com/tag/god/'}\n",
      "{'text': 'The Xperia X is the upcoming flagship phone from Sony and has been in the news ever since the Japanese manufacturer revealed the X and XA series at the MWC 2016 held in Barcelona this year. However, now the system dump for the Sony Xperia X F5121 is already available to download. TheXperia X and the XA devices are just around the corner and are expected to be launched in the next couple of months. The Sony Xperia X comes with an innovative design and the latest Android 6.0.1 Marshmallow firmware update that other devices like Xperia Z5, Xperia Z2, Z3, and Z4 have already received in many countries across the globe. You can check out more images and specifications of the Xperia X and XA from this page.\\nAs the system dump for Sony Xperia X F5121 has been leaked, it’s just a matter of time that the firmware will be ported to other Sony devices in the Xperia series. The full system dump is available to download from the F5121 firmware that comes with the firmware build number 34.0.A.1.264. The system dump weighs around 2 GB and is not a flashable zip file, just for testing and development purposes. The firmware v34.0.A.1.264 incorporates the latest Android 6.0.1 Marshmallow OS with December security patch. The stock full firmware should be expected after the worldwide release of Xperia X and we will be updating the link here once available. Find Firmware Screenshots from the Pinterest Board.\\n– Themes: Now every system app will have a different status bar color. (see the screenshots).\\n+ No more Google search bar on top Recent Panel.\\n+ New Clear All button (will show at end of Recent apps list).\\n+ Transparent on both Digital Clock widget at lockscreen (see screenshots).\\n+ No more gap between battery and signal icon.\\n+ No Quick Pulldown by default.\\nFollow and like us on social media. For queries, comment own below or leave a message in the forum. Here is the source.', 'timestamp': '2019-04-25 08:19:57', 'url': 'https://www.androidsage.com/2016/05/01/download-sony-xperia-x-f5121-sock-firmware-and-system-dump/'}\n",
