      "{'text': \"Search and compare available, short-term properties in Rockport to find your perfect vacation rental.\\nWe believe finding a vacation rental in Rockport should be easy and not take hours of searching and scrolling. We’ve designed VacationRenter from the ground up to help travelers find the perfect rental faster and easier.\\nThere are 221 vacation rentals near Rockport for all manner or mood of travel, availability of time off, and size of budget. So, if you are hoping for an affordable Rockport vacation, you can find 10% rentals under $150/night. Or if you are willing to splurge on a luxury vacation in Rockport, there are 22 between $643 and $1,556/night. Whether you are sleeping by yourself or with a significant other, or are travelling with a group of 20 there are short term home and apartment rentals in Rockport to fit your Massachusetts vacation needs. The most popular types of short-term rental homes in Rockport are houses, apartments and hotels. Rockport has been a frequently searched travel destination this year and continues to grow in popularity. VacationRenter offers a wide selection of vacation rental availability from leading travel sites like VRBO (Vacation Rentals By Owner), Homeaway, Booking.com, and many more. Search your travel dates to find available Rockport vacation homes for your trip.\\nLocated on the tip of Cape Ann, Rockport extends out into the Atlantic Ocean north ofGloucester, offering visitors tons of opportunities to get on or near the water. Consider these points of interest as you look for your vacation rental so you can avoid having to drive around town too much.\\nRockport is a small town largely dedicated to its tourism industry, so there's no shortage of vacation homes here. No matter where you stay, you'll have easy access to a number of great attractions.\\nBack Beach: Find this popular beach by walking through the downtown area on Main street and crossing Beach Street toward the ocean.\\nLoblolly Cove: Want to take some pictures or even see some marine wildlife, like seals? Loblolly Cove is a great place to stop.\\nMillbrook Meadow: Though it's located inland, this green space has historic significance for the area and may even be a place to go ice skating in wintertime.\", 'timestamp': '2019-04-26 04:36:24', 'url': 'https://www.vacationrenter.com/rentals/MA/rockport'}\n",
