      "{'text': 'Most caregivers are reluctant to ask for help from others. Many don’t want to burden family or friends. Others just don’t like asking for help. Some caregivers even believe that nobody else is qualified to help. But building a team of caregivers is crucial, not just for avoiding burnout but also to give your loved one the best quality of life possible. Who are you excluding from the caregiving experience?', 'timestamp': '2019-04-26 04:50:56', 'url': 'https://jenerationshealth.com/2018/06/08/what-party-planning-can-teach-us-about-caregiving-by-jennifer-l-fitzpatrick/'}\n",
      "{'text': 'Cut the stress out of wedding outfit shopping.\\nAugust and September are the most popular months of the year for Irish weddings – if you’re like us and have been invited to one or two but are stressing over what to be wearing, we’ve got you sorted with 13 looks that are absolutely GORGE.\\nStand out and look fab in canary yellow just like Amal Clooney did at the royal wedding.\\nTeam this fab tea skirt with a red, purple or black off the shoulder body suit for an outfit that’ll keep you looking glam all night.\\nWedding guest looks aren’t all about skirts and dresses, rock this fab rust coloured jumpsuit so you can have the look of being in a fancy frock but the comfort of being in trousers.\\nThis stunning cold shoulder midi dress is ideal for bringing pastels into Autumn.\\nEmerald green is a fab bold colour for any season so adding this one to your wardrobe is an investment that’ll see you down the years.\\nThis fab co-ord suit is perfect for those of you who hate wearing dresses. You’ll look formal yet stylish and the fab thing about this suit is that you can get matching shorts, meaning it won’t just sit in wardrobe after you only wearing it once.\\nThis beaut wrap dress is super flattering and comfortable which is exactly what you want from a wedding outfit. Team the rich plum colour up with some rose gold accessories and be the best dressed guest.\\nYellow has made a comeback in fashion this year and it’s deffo one to stay. Rock this gorge pleated number to be right on trend.\\nAutumn weddings are sure to have gloomy weather, be that pop of colour in this ruffled jumpsuit.\\nSometimes the hardest thing about opting for a skirt is finding a top to go with it so stick with a silk cami in lilac or black.\\nRed is such a classic autumnal colour. The prom skirt is sure to have you twirling around the dance floor.\\nNow you can relax and enjoy celebrating that special day.', 'timestamp': '2019-04-24 10:47:47', 'url': 'http://stellar.ie/beauty-fashion/13-gorgeous-outfits-youll-wanna-wear-to-an-autumn-wedding/60101'}\n",
      "{'text': 'Novel calixresorcinarene derivatives with four cholesterol units bridging by soft spacers or rigid Schiff-base spacers were prepared in yields of 63-76%. The hexagonal columnar liquid crystalline behaviors were firstly observed for calixresorcinarene derivatives. The mesomorphic properties were influenced greatly by the structures of spacers. The rigid spacers were favorable for enhancing the phase transition temperatures and enlarging the temperature scopes of mesophase.', 'timestamp': '2019-04-24 00:30:20', 'url': 'https://daneshyari.com/article/5408711'}\n",
      "{'text': 'BUD - Ferihegy Airport (BUD) 9.8 miles from Budapest, HU.\\nThere is 1 airport in Budapest. Ferihegy Airport (BUD) is Budapest’s primary airport with at least domestic flights and international flights departing from its runways every week. As of today, airlines operate out of Ferihegy Airport (BUD). Ferihegy Airport (BUD) is 9.8 miles from Budapest and offers nonstop flights to cities.', 'timestamp': '2019-04-20 03:15:32', 'url': 'https://seatguru.com/cheap-flights/274887/Cheap-Flights-to-Budapest'}\n",
      "{'text': \"吴佳斌, 张钰凡, 黄伟, 李俊兵. 空地DBS导弹最优制导律设计[J]. 西北工业大学学报, 2017, 35(3): 380-384.\\nWu Jiabin, Zhang Yufan, Huang Wei, Li Junbing. Design of Optimal Guidance Law of Air to Surface DBS Missile[J]. Journal of Northwestern Polytechnical University, 2017, 35(3): 380-384.\\n 左磊, 李明, 张晓伟. DBS多普勒中心无模糊估计新方法[J]. 西安电子科技大学学报, 2011, 38(5): 165-171.\\n Wiley C A. Synthetic Aperture Radar[J]. IEEE Trans on Aerosp Electron Syst, 1985, 21(3): 440-443.\\n 张刚, 祝明波, 周强, 等. SAR成像末制导交接班问题研究[J]. 现代防御技术, 2012, 40(6): 39-45.\\n 谢华英, 范红旗, 赵宏钟, 等. SAR成像导引头的弹道设计与优化[J]. 系统工程与电子技术, 2010, 32(2): 332-337.\\n 张刚, 祝明波, 陈瑜, 等. 基于SQP算法的SAR成像导引头三维弹道优化[J]. 计算机工程与科学, 2012, 34(4): 146-150.\\n 黄伟, 徐建城, 李俊兵, 等. 基于BiSAR制导的战斗机最优引导律及导弹最优制导律设计[J]. 西北工业大学学报, 2016, 35(3): 367-373.\\n 杨汝良. 高分辨率微波成像[M]. 北京: 国防工业出版社, 2013: 18-81.\\n Khanna S K, Mailer K. Aeronautical Radio Control System[M]. Moscow: Radio Technology Press, 2003: 65-81.\\nAbstract: For the guiding process of air to surface missiles applying Doppler Beam Sharpening technology, an optimization algorithm of guidance law based on miss distance, imaging resolution and economy is proposed. Based on Doppler Beam Sharpening imaging geometry, the model between resolution at the azimuth and missile's motion parameters is build and the restraint between imaging constraint and miss distance is analyzed. Kinematic of missile and target is established in the azimuth plane, the requirement of imaging is converted to constraints for lead angle of the missile, and the requirement of miss distance is converted to constraints for angular velocity of line of sight. Optimal guidance law of missile is designed by taking missile's acceleration as control variable on the basis of optimum control theory. Simulation results demonstrate the validity of the arithmetic.\\nJournal of Northwestern Polytechnical University, 2017, 35(3): 380-384.\", 'timestamp': '2019-04-25 04:37:28', 'url': 'http://journals.nwpu.edu.cn/xbgydxxb/FileUp/HTML/20170304.htm'}\n",
