      "{'text': 'It has been an exciting journey since the team was born. We have taken part on different competitions and the team has started to grow. After the summer new competitions will be taking place meanwhile it is time to enjoy the good weather and prepare for the challenges ahead.\\nIn the last month the team finished its participation in the StockCar Series with a remarkable participation of Ricker in the final endurance event. He finished 6th in the total standings while Oliver finished 13th with just 4 participations. Together they positioned GOTeam in the 4th position of the team championship.\\nThe team also took part in the 3rd round of the sumer gokart cup race. After a difficult qualify session Georgi and Oliver were qualified in the Final-B where Oliver managed to defend the pole and bring the victory home to get the runner-up place for the Final-A. Starting last he tried his best to gain positions, he fought through the traffic the whole race and finished 12th in middle of the lot. After 3 out of 6 rounds Oliver is fighting top 10 in total standings while Georgi and our new driver Ronnie are in the battle for the top 15 with 1 race less.\\nMeanwhile Georgi has signed up for the ApexOnlineracing GT3 leagues and is planning to take part in their 8th Season of their GT3 championship after the summer break. Until then he is racing in the their weekly sprintraces to keep his form.', 'timestamp': '2019-04-19 12:58:32', 'url': 'https://goteamracing.com/summer-break/'}\n",
