      "{'text': 'Some mornings the sun invites you to rest on the steps.\\nAnd you stop to pose for a pic.\\nBut get bored with the posing, so you move on to more important things.\\nThis entry was posted in Positive Thinking, Random Thoughts and tagged Bubbles, the cat. Bookmark the permalink.\\nAw, Bubbles found a sun puddle! Adorable kitty and such cute pics! Have a great week!\\nWe should be more like cats – find a sun puddle, plop down and soak it up!\\nDon’t get me started on my hair! But I love Bubbles hair.\\nAw, Bubbles, so pretty. Is he/she slightly cross-eyed? Sheds fur?\\nlove the post, needed this!\\nI’m glad it helped in some way. 🙂 Have a good day and thank you for stopping by.\\nCat hair balls are just the worst…ick!\\nI need to find Bubbles’ hairdresser!', 'timestamp': '2019-04-24 04:44:35', 'url': 'https://justmakethecoffee.com/2016/04/04/bubbles-the-adorable/'}\n",
