      "{'text': '08:00 AM: Breakfast. 08:45 AM: Check out then leave Hotel for Cuc Phuong National Park through beatiful countryside roads.\\n10:45 AM: Arrive at Cuc Phuong National Park, visit Endangered Primate Rescue Center, about 30 minutes, visit monkey and Turtle Conservation Program.\\n13:30 PM: Two different hikes: To the “1000 years old Tree” and to the “Ancient Tree”. You can choose between mountainous trekking or trekking over flat paths.\\n16:00 PM: Visit Nguoi Sua Kep Cave, the “Cave of Prehistoric Man”. In 1996 graves and tools were excavated here dating back 7500 years making it one of the oldesrt sites of human babitation in VietNam. Free time to relax, walk around the Park.\\n08:00 AM: Have Breakfast. 09:30 AM: Chech out and leave at Kenh Ga Floating Village.\\n10:30 AM: Arrive in Kenh Ga Floating Village take a motorboat, tour through the wetlands and countryside over the river.\\n13:00 PM: Have free time to explorer the village.\\n14:30 PM: Arrive at Hang Mua. Walk around the Park, climb the mountain, explore the cave.\\n15:30 PM: Leave Hang Mua back in Tam Coc the taking bus to backing Ha Noi.\\n18:00 AM: Arrive back Ha Noi. End of Tour.\\n– All transport, lunch, dinner, breakfast, rest, entrance fees, guide.', 'timestamp': '2019-04-21 01:26:58', 'url': 'http://huecitytour.com/tour/ninh-binh-tour-3-days-2-nights'}\n",
