      "{'text': 'Finding the perfect home is hard. Knowing which home loan fits you best shouldn’t be. Because a home loan is something you’ll live with for a long time, we want to help make sure you get one that fits. We have several loans to choose from and experts to help you with the important decisions along the way so that buying or refinancing your home is a breeze.\\nThe advantages of a Conventional Home Loan are the predictable monthly payment and the ability to spread payments out over a long period of time.\\nAdjustable-rate home loans come with a shorter “locked-rate” period, and typically include lower interest rates during that term. ARMs are ideal for borrowers with a shorter term ownership plan.\\nIf you’re looking for a low down payment, an FHA Loan may be the best fit.\\nVA home loans are designed to specifically help veterans finance property and are guaranteed by the Department of Veterans Affairs.\\nSpecial financing may be available for areas deemed rural by the United States Department of Agriculture.\\nReady to build? Our construction loans provide funding for the construction process, and then we can help convert you to a home loan that fits your needs when construction is complete.\\nYour First Southern loan expert will help analyze your needs, explain your options and answer your questions.', 'timestamp': '2019-04-20 07:18:35', 'url': 'https://www.fsnb.net/loans/home'}\n",
