      "{'text': 'Happy New Year from Lolligag (and Moot)!\\nWishing you the sweetest of celebrations tonight… and for 2013! Here’s a quick pic of me and Moot ringing in the new year.\\nHere’s a special Lolligag e-card just for you!\\nIt’s a tough job, but somebody’s gotta do it.\\nJust in time for the holidays, the Lolligag Kids collection of tees is now available for purchase in our online shop! And as always, enjoy free shipping!!', 'timestamp': '2019-04-21 08:36:26', 'url': 'http://www.lolligagworld.com/2012/12/'}\n",
      "{'text': 'Ø¶Ø§Ù\\x86 1433 http://www.dramauk.co.uk/?arapyza=%D8%A7%D8%B3%D8%AA%D8%B6%D8%A7%D9%81%D8%A9-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%AE%D8%A7%D8%AF%D9%85-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%AE%D8%A7%D8%B5-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%A5%D9%81%D8%AA%D8%B1%D8%A7%D8%B6%D9%8A-%D8%A8%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%81%D9%88%D8%B1%D9%83%D8%B3&cf3=04 http://investingtips360.com/?klaystrofobiya=%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%A7%D8%B3%D9%87%D9%85-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B3%D8%B9%D9%88%D8%AF%D9%8A%D9%87-%D9%84%D9%84%D8%A7%D8%B3%D8%AA%D8%AB%D9%85%D8%A7%D8%B1-2014&d1a=c1 الاسهم السعوديه للاستثمار 2014 http://theiu.org/?alisa=%D8%AA%D8%AF%D8%A7%D9%88%D9%84-%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%81%D9%88%D8%B1%D9%83%D8%B3-%D9%81%D9%8A-%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%87%D9%86%D8%AF&843=34 Yesterday my family and I went to visit one of our favourite National Trust properties, Waddesdon Manor. We had planned the visit as a surprise for my Grandma, who has recently moved back to England, as the house is decorated and illuminated for Christmas and the grounds host Bruce Munro’s ‘Field of Light’ installation. Unfortunately the weather was against us as it rained continuously throughout the day but it did not spoil our enjoyment of the day or stop us getting in the festive mood.\\nThe house was decorated beautifully with the theme of ‘Magical Materials’. Each room featured a different material from precious materials such as gold and silver through to more everyday materials such as paper. Each room was so detailed and well presented that it was impossible to know where to look first. A gingerbread man was hidden in each room for children to find as part of a trail. However I enjoyed it just as much as the young children as they were decorated so intricately.\\nAfter a stroll around the Christmas market and a quick lunch we headed down to The Stables to see the Biscuiteers creation of a gingerbread Waddesdon Manor. It was amazing and looked exactly like the real house itself. Every little painting and piece of furniture appeared to have been replicated. I particularly liked the Billiards Room with the scoreboard on show. It reminded of the Queen Mary’s Dolls House at Windsor Castle because of the attention to detail.\\nOnce we had warmed ourselves up we had a walk around the grounds to see the house illuminated in different colours and to see Bruce Munro’s ‘Field of Light’. We saw this installation last year but I think it was bigger this time which made it even more impressive. It was well worth getting soaked and muddy to see!\\nThere is nothing I love more than the lights at Christmas and seeing how different places are decorated. After visiting Waddesdon I am finally in a Christmasy mood and ready to put up our own Christmas tree. I would highly recommend going to visit the house and grounds, especially at Christmas, as it is so stunning.\\nHave you been to Waddesdon Manor or another National Trust property? Are there any places you would recommend visiting at Christmas? I would love to hear if anyone had any suggestions!', 'timestamp': '2019-04-25 08:51:50', 'url': 'http://ontheslipside.com/feeling-festive-at-waddesdon-manor/'}\n",
      "{'text': 'This past Sunday I had the pleasure of attending the P3 Beauty Tea @ Studio Wed. The space was a perfect, vendors on point and tea amazing. I had such a wonder time and met so many lovely ladies.\\nS. Willis also gave me a smokey eye but with the color blue, and I must say that I love it!!! I never had a smokey eye before and I can’t wait to try it out again. Sidenote: Yes I see my eyebrows need to be done ASAP, but I had to let them grow back out and I’m on the search to find a new eyebrow person 🙂 If anyone knows someone in the Atlanta area please let know (I don’t do wax mostly razor or thread).\\nMs. CL Felder of Spoiled Diva. I just love this clutch of hers that she is holding, I need it in my life. The feathers also come off so that you can attach it to other things!\\nUs bloggers stay on our phones!', 'timestamp': '2019-04-25 12:23:32', 'url': 'https://fmfashionmixer.wordpress.com/tag/studio-wed/'}\n",
      "{'text': 'The researchers decided to find an alternative stain which is less expensive and less hazardous to the health. The study utilized a randomized posttest only experimental control groups to determine the potential of Alugbati (Basella alba) fruit and Mangosteen (Garcinia mangostana) pericarps extractives as substitute for Crystal Violet and Safranin in Gram staining technique. Ninety-five percent (95%) ethanol was used to extract juice from 200 grams of Mangosteen pericarps and 150 grams of Alugbati fruit. Eight slides were smeared with Staphylococcus aureus and eight slides were smeared with Escherichia coli. When using the Gram staining procedure, none of the slides were stained with Alugbati (Basella alba) as an alternative for Crystal Violet and Mangosteen pericarps (Garcinia mangostana) as alternative for Safranin. However, when extracts of Alugbati fruit and Mangosteen pericarps were used solely, it faintly stained both Staphylococcus aureus and Escherichia coli.\\nThe findings of the study were presented, analyzed and interpreted in this chapter in four (4) sections; the number of slides of Staphylococcus aureus stained with Alugbati fruit extractive as compared to Crystal Violet, the number of slides of Escherichia coli stained with Mangosteen pericarps extractive as compared to Safranin, a significant difference between the proportions of slides positive for staining of Staphylococcus aureus using Alugbati fruit extractive and Crystal Violet, a significant difference between the proportions of slides positive for staining of Escherichia coli using Mangosteen pericarps extractive and Safranin. No slides were stained with Alugbati fruit extractive and Mangosteen Pericarps extractive.\\nBased on the findings, Alugbati fruit extractive and Mangosteen pericarps did not have the potential as staining agents on bacteria. The researchers also recommend that modifications to the Gram staining technique should be considered when using alternative stains.\\n8. Forbes, B , Sahm, D , Weissfeld, A . . Bailey & Scott’s Diagnostic Microbiology (12th ed.). St. Louis, Missouri: Mosby, Inc., 2007.', 'timestamp': '2019-04-22 18:28:06', 'url': 'http://www.herdin.ph/index.php/herdin-home?view=research&cid=58687'}\n",
      "{'text': 'What Electric Grill Vs Gas At Bellevue Pros Do (and you ought Too) – Are Electric Grills Healthy? When it comes to the meals you eat every day, more and more people are switching to a wellness lifestyle instead of fad diets. These individuals have noticed that the way to sustain a wholesome weight and diet plan is to consume healthy over time.\\nIn general, grilling is a much better way to get ready food weighed against other alternatives. For instance, grilled food typically has much less grease than food that is fried. There are always a couple items to look out for in purchase to make sure you are maximizing the health benefits of your grill. The foremost is to select foods that are lower in fat and calories (think chicken and seafood, instead of beef or pork).\\nAs such, it makes sense to believe about how to prepare well balanced meals. When people are interested in purchasing electric grills, among the first queries they have are if the electric grills certainly are a healthy way to prepare food.\\nSecondly, there are known compounds that have been linked to cancer, which can get onto the food when you grill outdoors. Below we review some more specific recommendations to help with making grilling a lot more healthy.\\nActually, most grills will actually allow you to grill veggies right on the tray together with your various other food, which really is a nice way to include some added flavor. The cancer causing compounds only adhere to meat, so you aren’t eating these compounds in case you are making veggies or fresh fruit on the grill.\\nAt this stage, you may be wondering which vegetables are the best grill. You may already know that onions and tomatoes are generally added to boost health benefits, but there are several others that you could include as well.\\nConsider adding corn, peppers, eggplant, zucchini, plus some of your other preferred veggies. If you would like to try to boost your fruit intake, you could also consider looking for grilling quality recipes that include pineapple, apple, mango, or pear.\\nIn terms of reducing the cancer causing compounds that might get on your meat during the grilling process, the ultimate way to avoid this is through prevention. Ensure that you trim the excess fat off your meats before grilling.\\nThus, you are targeting lean cuts of meat. Using your preferred marinade may also decrease the number of HCAs that adhere to your meat (and therefore, that you’ll consume). Other ways to prevent the build-up of the cancer causing molecules include flipping your food and grilling for lower time.\\nIt is important to note that these cancer causing compounds only stick to grills that use charcoal. Thus, another great way to avoid them is usually to simply use a power grill.\\nUnderstanding that you are worried about your wellness, there are a variety of things that you’ll want to consider whenever choosing your electric grill. One of the first issues is if there exists a drip tray.\\nThis will take away the extra fat, grease, and oil that comes off your meat (and other food) instead of having it absorbed by the meals. Ensure that you read the evaluations about the drainage system, so that you can make sure the drainage system actually works well.\\nSecondly, consider looking for plates that are removable and perhaps dishwasher safe. Since you will be cooking raw meat on the plates, you will want to ensure that you can clean your electric grill well.\\nUnfortunately, some electric grills do not have removable plates. This makes it incredibly difficult to thoroughly clean your grill just before the next use.\\nIf you are trying to eat healthy, the electric grill can help you in this endeavor. In fact, they are well suited for individuals who business lead an active way of life and who are interested in preparing quick meals.\\nWhile they could have a valid point regarding the taste, if you are unable to have a charcoal or gas grill where you live, the electric grill might indeed be an excellent substitute. Given that many apartments forbid charcoal and gas grills; electric grills are well suited for apartment living.\\nWhen it comes to electric grilling, you may have more cooking options than with a gas or charcoal grill. It is because many electric grills include different plates to allow you to cook different items.\\nFurthermore, most grills come with drip trays with are added to help reduce the amount of fat and calories that you consume. In addition, the electric grills tend to be easier to transport and store than traditional grills.\\nElectric grills are a safer alternative to gas a charcoal grills. You will want to be sure to obtain a power grill that has a drip tray if you want to increase the health benefits of a power grill.\\nIn addition, you will want to be certain that you are eating enough vegetables and fruits to supplement the yummy meats and seafood that can be produced on the electric grill. Overall, the electric grills will be much less prone to capturing the malignancy causing compounds in your meal.\\nElectric grills have grown to be so much common in the current globe compared to other types of grills. It has been facilitated by the countless advantages and benefits that the many electrical grills come with. However, to ensure that the electric grill of your decision provides you with the maximum benefits it is usually important to ensure that you select the best kind of an electric grill which will suit all of your different needs. finding the right electric grill is preferred especially to the very first time buyers because of the following reasons.\\nOne of the biggest reasons why most of us need best electric grills for our homes is because of their capability to help us save a lot of costs that we would incur by utilization of other styles of grills or vehicle’s gas tank. By installing the best electric grill in your house there is no need to continuously change it as or actually hook it up to any type of a gas series. This are a number of the things that make electric grills the very best choices to the majority of the homesteads. The various other greatest advantage that is included with best electric grills is the advanced of convenience they come with. Using an electric grill for your cooking purposes won’t take so much of your cooking area compared to other traditional grills or gas tanks. It’s can be very easy to sustain your electric grill in comparison to other styles about the grills. Maintaining an electric grill merely means cleaning it on daily basis. This is one of the most crucial things that plays a part in the durability of electric grills. Cleaning of the electrical grills also make them so much practical cooking utensils. The other reason why choosing the best electric grill can be important is because electric grills put in a lot in enhancing the living circumstances of your house. Electric grills do not produce numerous fumes which might end up bringing on atmosphere pollution in your house. This is a very important thing to the health of the residents at home.\\nHowever, it is usually important to have some guidelines in mind before buying any kind of an electric grill. You should be guaranteed that you are buying the best electric grill. Some of the most crucial things that you ought to look are the top features of the electric grill. Be sure that the electric grill has the best adjustable thermostat, a good removable food preparation plate or grate, enough cord duration among a great many other features which will help you in getting the best electric grill, view Home Page for more details!\\nWho doesn’t love the convenience of turning a deal with and clicking a button to get things heading? Gas grills are quite convenient to use. You just get them going and have knobs to improve the intensity of the heat. Typically, gas grills are available in larger sizes with multiple racks which gives you more cooking food space. Meats still create natural smoke when sizzling on the grill which really does in turn enhance the flavor in comparison to food preparation in a pan or skillet. With regards to temperatures control and overall cooking food control, gas grills are usually favored.\\nCharcoal Grills bring a unique, rich, smoky taste to the table that is unmatchable. They are affordable. Charcoal grills really provide the authenticity and simplicity to the event of grilling that people can all appreciate and appreciate. Personally, i love watching the charcoals convert grey. Charcoal grills make for a healthy option when trying to take less fat. The fat on meats drip aside from the meat instead of soak into it if you were cooking them in a pan or skillet.\\nFirst away, if you work with petroleum-based lighter fluid, you are adding a health risk at that moment separate from charcoal. It itself creates Volatile Organic Substances (VOC’s) and leaves petroleum residue on the food and in your valuable lungs! The common bear does make use of lighter fluid to get their coals burning so make sure you do some research for alternative solutions to obtain your coal burning up. You can examine out electric coal starters (typically $10-20) for a wholesome approach of lighting your coals. Charcoals are also a little more unpredictable when it involves the strength of the flame which can put you or others at harm of fire and/or risk of burn off. Charcoal also produces carbon monoxide, a deadly gas if inhaled directly. Make sure to individual yourself and be in a well-ventilated area if doing charcoal grilling to further decrease health risks.\\nHCA’s (Heterocylic Amines) are produced when proteins are cooked at high temperatures. HCA’s have been discovered to provide cancer to lab pets. There has been no research indicating the same results for humans. This gives the gas grill an enormous health advantage over the charcoal grill due to the fact that you can to have a lot more control over the quantity of high temperature and flame that the foods face. With charcoal grills, it is much harder to control this and therefore leaves it at higher risk of creating more HCA’s present in the meals. Gas grills are favored when it comes to temperature control.\\nIs Gas Grill Healthier Than Charcoal? Yes. There are certain ways to minimize the health risks associated with charcoal grilling electronic.g. marinating, using alternative choices to ignite the coals. However, there are too many factors that make it a wellness risk to actively prepare with charcoal. If used in moderation, it really is probably just good to grill with charcoal. In case you are a grilling enthusiast, utilizing a gas grill is vital. You provide yourself with a standard superior product, particularly when it comes to your health.\\nAs it may be known that lots of cooks prefer to use charcoal to prepare to further enhance the taste of their feasts, it is a path that needs to be less traveled. To avoid some of the harmful carcinogens and HCA’s, it’s been a practice to marinate your meats for 30m or longer to reduce the unwanted effects absorbed into the food by cooking food with charcoal. It may actually reduce up to 90% of the harmful chemicals absorbed which have been told to cause cancer. 10% continues to be more than I’d prefer to play with individually. On rare event, charcoal is a good choice for taste filled entrees.\\nGas Grills are a lot more healthy. There are no known chemical substances becoming absorbed into your foods except the equivalent threat of HCA’s (when meals is prepared at high temperature). However, the temp control on gas grills offers you the opportunity to remove that risk entirely. Gas grills still supply the same advantage of charcoal grills with regards to leaving the prepared item with less fat. However, there are much less physical risks and many much less health risks involved when utilizing a gas grill.\\nFirst, cover the gas valves with aluminum foil to protect the connections from corrosion. Clean the grill’s interior and exterior areas with a long-taken care of stiff-wire grill brush and warm, soapy water. Rinse completely and towel dry, after that reattach the gas tubes and burners.\\nMake sure the propane tank is definitely turned off. Remove the briquettes and cooking food grates, and cautiously detach the gas tubes and burner. Clean the tubes with warm, soapy drinking water and towel dry. Clean the burner clean with a damp cloth. Towel dried out the gas ports on the burner, then clean out each one with a toothpick.\\nAwesome the grill after burning away the grease. Take away the briquettes and cooking grates and scrub the grates with a long-handled stiff-cable grill brush and warm, soapy water. Towel dried out, then replace, combined with the briquettes.\\nDuring the grill season, briquettes transfer temperature to the cooking grates, leaving them covered with grease. Before firing up your grill for the season’s inaugural cookout, flip over the briquettes, close the lid, and high temperature the grill on high for quarter-hour.\\nExamine and replenish your propane or natural gas supply as required. Corroding and rusted tanks should be recycled; return your container to a propane supplier or verify local listings for tank recycling companies.\\nJust as you did in the beginning of the season, flip more than the briquettes, close the lid, and heat the grill upon high for a quarter-hour. Then let cool.\\nIf storing outside, protect the grill’s external with a vinyl cover and keep carefully the propane tank attached. If storing the grill indoors, disconnect the tank and keep it outside, position upright, in a shady location away from dryer or furnace vents. Cover the gas collection connections on the grill to ward off insects.\\nThank’s for looking through this article. I expect you receive more than enough written content from now. If you need to send me a message, you should let me know by Simly click here. Need to see the Site? I highly recommend you wellcome.', 'timestamp': '2019-04-18 17:15:34', 'url': 'http://bbqlovers.net/what-electric-grill-vs-gas-at-bellevue-pros-do-and-you-ought-too/'}\n",
      "{'text': 'YalGames Escape Through Mountain is another point and click escape game developed by YalGames Team. Play Escape Through Mountain escape game and have a fun!!!', 'timestamp': '2019-04-25 11:56:54', 'url': 'http://www.games2jolly.com/escape-games/yalgames-escape-through-mountain'}\n",
      "{'text': \"This award-winning contemporary classic is the survival story with which all others are compared--and a page-turning, heart-stopping adventure, recipient of the Newbery Honor. Hatchet has also been nominated as one of America's best-loved novels by PBS's The Great American Read.\\nThirteen-year-old Brian Robeson, haunted by his secret knowledge of his mother's infidelity, is traveling by single-engine plane to visit his father for the first time since the divorce. When the plane crashes, killing the pilot, the sole survivor is Brian. He is alone in the Canadian wilderness with nothing but his clothing, a tattered windbreaker, and the hatchet his mother had given him as a present.\\nAt first consumed by despair and self-pity, Brian slowly learns survival skills--how to make a shelter for himself, how to hunt and fish and forage for food, how to make a fire--and even finds the courage to start over from scratch when a tornado ravages his campsite. When Brian is finally rescued after fifty-four days in the wild, he emerges from his ordeal with new patience and maturity, and a greater understanding of himself and his parents.\", 'timestamp': '2019-04-23 14:39:31', 'url': 'https://store.loganberrybooks.com/category/great-am-read'}\n",
      "{'text': 'Question: Researchers have hypothesized that the proverbial rose-colored glasses might indeed help lessen depression caused by light deprivation. A random sample of 32 people suffering light deprivation depression were given a depression inventory exam, and it was found that on the scale their average measure was 28 with sample standard deviation 3.5. Another random sample of 38 people suffering light deprivation depression wore rose-tinted glasses. They were subjected to the same light deprivation conditions as the other sample. On the depression inventory exam their mean scale reading was 22 with standard deviation 3.0. Test the claim that the rose-colored glasses reduce the reading on the depression inventory exam. Use a 1% level of significance.', 'timestamp': '2019-04-18 13:04:17', 'url': 'https://www.statstutor.net/downloads/question-2011420-confidence-intervals/'}\n",
      "{'text': 'Ten days after that, Kentucky will head up to No. 4 Notre Dame.\\nWhile these games seem big on paper, Coach Matthew Mitchell cautioned that they aren\\'t going to make or break the season.\\n\"What we\\'re playing for is to see how good this team can become,\" he said after UK won its seventh straight game on Sunday, whipping Mississippi Valley State at Memorial Coliseum. \"Not any one of those games coming up is going to define our season, but it will certainly let us know where we are.\"', 'timestamp': '2019-04-21 16:21:15', 'url': 'https://www.kentucky.com/sports/college/kentucky-sports/uk-basketball-women/article44140527.html'}\n",
      "{'text': \"Fundamentals of Differential Equations presents the basic theory of differential equations and offers a variety of modern applications in science and engineering. Available in two versions, these flexible texts offer the instructor many choices in syllabus design, course emphasis (theory, methodology, applications, and numerical methods), and in using commercially available computer software. Fundamentals of Differential Equations, Seventh Edition is suitable for a one-semester sophomore- or junior-level course. Fundamentals ofDifferential Equations with Boundary Value Problems, Fifth Edition, contains enough material for a two-semester course that covers and builds on boundary value problems. The Boundary Value Problems version consists of the main text plus three additional chapters (Eigenvalue Problems and Sturm-Liouville Equations; Stability of Autonomous Systems; and Existence and Uniqueness Theory).Nagle, R. Kent is the author of 'Fundamentals of Differential Equations with Boundary Value Problems with IDE CD (Saleable Package)' with ISBN 9780321419217 and ISBN 0321419219.\", 'timestamp': '2019-04-21 18:14:25', 'url': 'https://www.valorebooks.com/textbooks/fundamentals-of-differential-equations-with-boundary-value-problems-with-ide-cd-saleable-package-5th-edition/9780321419217'}\n",
