      "{'text': \"SAN JACINTO, Calif. - After leading the Soboba Band of Luiseno Indians for nearly three decades, Robert Salgado is facing one of his greatest challenges - to set aside years of suspicion and to trust the Riverside County Sheriff's Department.\\nFor the past three weeks, the two sides have met behind closed doors to prevent the kind of violence that led to the deaths of three tribal members in shootouts with deputies in May.\\nSalgado says the path for the sheriff's department is clear.\", 'timestamp': '2019-04-25 00:36:50', 'url': 'http://freedmenvscherokeenation.blogspot.com/2008/06/ca-tribes-and-public-law-280.html'}\n",
      "{'text': 'Hello - having a problem with Zerobrane not bridging a connection with Gideros player using OSX 10.9.5 any solution for this?\\nMerhaba atılım hocam yaptığım projeye reklam ekliyemiyorum ingilizcem iyi değil yardım edermisin?\\nFYI i just noticed a mistake in the documentation http://docs.giderosmobile.com/reference/plugin/flurry#flurry It shows iOS and Android support icons, but then Flurry.isAvailable doc says \"Currently, Flurry is available only for iOS.\"\\natilim, I am very interested in use of your example of TextWrap2. But I very much need that the text right after loading was shown not since the beginning, but at once scrolled to the end. Please, help me! I am engaged in development of a new engine for Interactive Fiction. I work over more of bot`s Artificial intelligence, and I am quite weak in user interface. Therefore I very much ask you to help with this completion of TextWrap2.\\nhi, ı am trying to upload video on gideros. ıs there any way to do this. can you help me please?\\natilim changed his profile picture.\\nhi atilim. I have a little suggestion for MovieClip. Keep an internal reference for an movie clip before it\\'s completed and dereference it when completed. Two reasons for that: 1.We will not need to make a reference for a local movie clip and dereference it when it\\'s completed just for preventing it from collectgarbage. 2. it become very Simple to add MovieClip.stopAll() if all the movie clips are referenced. And BTW, do you have any plan to add particle engine.\\nHey atilim, is there any way to implement in-app purchases on Android at the moment? I have a great app idea that requires in-app purchases that I want to release simultaneously on iOS and Android - if I have to back burner the idea until later, let me know. Thanks!\\nAgree! Need some kind of lua->java bridge to call java from lua.\\nI want to create sprites with the same level of hierarchy in the scene. Please tell me how I can do that.\\nHi atilim, I had searched the forum with numerous search queries but could not find how to add code \\'quoteing\\' with syntax on the forum, can you help me out?\\nHello atilim. I tested the tilemap sample on the player in my Android HTC desire. I get around 4-5 FPS. It this something that you guys will try to improve?', 'timestamp': '2019-04-23 06:07:45', 'url': 'http://forum.giderosmobile.com/profile/atilim'}\n",
