      "{'text': \"Why study the mysterious writings in Revelation? Does the end of the story really matter? No book in Scripture has been more misunderstood or misinterpreted than John's prophecy. Pastor John MacArthur removes doubt and the cloud of obscurity to reveal the only New Testament text that includes a promised spiritual blessing for those who heed its message. This book is compiled from the two best-selling volumes from the MacArthur New Testament Commentary Series.\", 'timestamp': '2019-04-25 07:53:50', 'url': 'http://christian-book-store.christiansunite.com/10185EB/Because-the-Time-is-Near:-John-MacArthur-Explains-the-Book-of-Revelation---eBook.shtml'}\n",
