      "{'text': \"The first half of the April Games with Gold has now arrived for Xbox Live Gold members to claim. Xbox One owners can grab a hold of The Technomancer, while Xbox 360 owners can get Star Wars Battlefront II for free, this is the 2005 classic version. Also, as the latter title is in Microsoft's original Xbox backward compatibility program, it can be claimed and played natively on Xbox One consoles.\\nFight on the front lines where every weapon and vehicle is yours. And now for the first time, Star Wars Battlefront II lets you... Fight as a Jedi - Earn the ability to wield a lightsaber and use Force powers like Yoda, Darth Vader and many other Heroes and Villains.\\nDon't forget that Plants vs. Zombies Garden Warfare 2 will be available for free to Xbox One owners until April 15, from the previous Games with Gold promotion. This will be replaced by Outcast - Second Contact on April 16.\", 'timestamp': '2019-04-20 14:42:44', 'url': 'https://www.neowin.net/news/games-with-gold-star-wars-battlefront-ii-and-the-technomancer-are-now-free'}\n",
      "{'text': 'Why do we have merchandise at the Information Point?\\nEverything we sell at the Information Point produces income to the appeal funds which we use to support projects and information in the parks. Recent projects have included the restoration of the Water Gardens and Diana Fountain in Bushy Park and the provision of eel survey equipment and barn owl habitats in Home Park.\\nMaps of Bushy Park. Leaflets about the two parks’ wildlife and habitats. Booklets about the history of Bushy Park during World War Two. Guides to different walks in the parks. Children’s bird and insect spotting sheets. Souvenir pin badges and key fobs. Postcards and greetings cards.\\nYou must try the delicious locally produced honey from hives in Bushy Park.', 'timestamp': '2019-04-20 22:46:02', 'url': 'http://fbhp.org.uk/info-point/merchandise.php'}\n",
